# headroom demo
Output demo.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 960
Set Height 540
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

# Launch demo mode — choreographed sequence plays automatically and quits
Hide
Type "./headroom --demo"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Show

# Loading animation + bar sweep + full demo sequence
# Total runtime ~16s: 4s loading, 1.2s bars, then demo steps + auto-quit
Sleep 16s
